### Smart Loan Tracker API - Loan Endpoints
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@authToken = your-auth-token-here
@loanId = loan-id-here

### Create New Loan
POST {{baseUrl}}/loans
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lenderUserId": "lender-user-id",
  "borrowerUserId": "borrower-user-id",
  "lenderName": "John Doe",
  "borrowerName": "Jane Smith",
  "amount": 1000,
  "reason": "Emergency loan",
  "dueDate": "2024-12-31T00:00:00.000Z"
}

### Get All Loans (Current User)
GET {{baseUrl}}/loans
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Get All Loans - Filter by Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/loans?status=active
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Get All Loans - Filter by Role
GET {{baseUrl}}/loans?role=lender
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Get All Loans - Filter by Status and Role
GET {{baseUrl}}/loans?status=active&role=borrower
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Get Loan By ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/loans/{{loanId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Update Loan
PUT {{baseUrl}}/loans/{{loanId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "active",
  "amount": 1500,
  "reason": "Updated reason",
  "dueDate": "2025-01-31T00:00:00.000Z",
  "balanceRemaining": 800
}

### Accept Loan Request
POST {{baseUrl}}/loans/{{loanId}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Record Payment
POST {{baseUrl}}/loans/{{loanId}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 200
}

### Get Payment History
GET {{baseUrl}}/loans/{{loanId}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Delete Loan
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/loans/{{loanId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

